This kernel is built from Chrome 152 extended stable 152.0.7977.140, which
carries the security fixes Google backported to 152. The Chrome version a
page sees without --fingerprint-brand-version (and the version list that
002 picks from by seed) now starts at this release instead of the 152
stable release 152.0.7977.85. persona-profiles always passes the version
from its kernel manifest, which is 152.0.7977.140 as well.

